			+ "PrepareTreeOfAWorktree(PrepareTreeTestCase):"
	SPEC "given -- <awawa args>, it runs awawa with those args at the root of the tree and passes"
		+ "its stdout, stderr and exit code through unchanged, the resolved SHA on one stderr line"
