TASK B60
	TITLE "retention of runs/: after each result written, the finished and dead runs beyond"
		+ "runs_kept are removed, a running run never"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M1
	COMPONENT "runs"
	ROLE bastien
	DESC "draft: the key runs_kept, its default of 100 and the lock name are proposals for the"
		+ "refinement"
	DESC "for the refinement: a run @TASK.B19 resumes from its progress file and a study @TASK.B48"
		+ "restarts at its first undone step hold no live pid; whether the retention spares them"
		REF @TASK.B19
		REF @TASK.B48
	SPEC "after brigade run writes result.json, the finished and dead runs of"
		+ "$XDG_STATE_HOME/brigade/runs/ beyond runs_kept of config.toml, 100 by default, are"
		+ "removed, oldest first by the time of result.json or, dead, of run.json; finished and"
		+ "dead are those of brigade runs list"
	SPEC "a running run, its pid alive without result.json, is never removed; runs_kept below 1 is"
		+ "an error naming the key and the file"
	SPEC "a removal runs under $XDG_STATE_HOME/brigade/locks/runs.lock and renames the directory"
		+ "out of runs/ before deleting it: brigade runs list meets a whole run or none"
	SPEC "tests/cli prove the removal beyond the bound, the running run kept, the dead run removed"
		+ "and the bound read from config.toml, through the fake adapter in a temporary state"
		+ "directory"
