	RATIONALE "the writer prunes after each write, the pattern of @TASK.B08 for the refs cache:"
		+ "brigade run bounds runs/ with or without a scheduler, where the tick of @TASK.B07 would"
		+ "record a prune action in the ledger at each tick and plans nothing before @TASK.B12 adds"
